' control / DAO -- entity
' =====================================================================
AuthenticationController "1" -- "0..*" User : authenticates
EventController "1" -- "0..*" EmergencyEvent : manages
TaskController "1" -- "0..*" Task : manages
ReservationController "1" -- "0..*" Assignment : creates
