' =====================================================================
' DESIGN PATTERN NOTE
' =====================================================================
note as StrategyNote
  <b>Design Pattern: Strategy</b>
  Where: ReservationController (Context) holds
  AllocationStrategy (abstract Strategy);
  NearestLocationStrategy is a Concrete Strategy.
  ReservationController.autoAllocate() picks the strategy
  by the AllocationCriterion the Dispatcher selected.
  Serves: FR-04 automatic allocation by a selected criterion,
  and the story's demand that new criteria can be added later:
  a new criterion = one new subclass + one enum value,
  with no change to ReservationController.
end note
StrategyNote .. AllocationStrategy
StrategyNote .. ReservationController
